@baseUrl = http://localhost:9899/validation

### 1. JSON 校验通过：POST /validation/json
POST {{baseUrl}}/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tutorials4j",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. JSON 校验失败：username 太短、password 太短
POST {{baseUrl}}/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "123"
}

### 3. 表单校验通过：POST /validation/form
POST {{baseUrl}}/form
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=张三&email=zhangsan@example.com

### 4. 表单校验失败：name 为空、email 为空
POST {{baseUrl}}/form
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=&email=

### 5. @RequestParam 校验通过：GET /validation/param?name=abc
GET {{baseUrl}}/param?name=abc

### 6. @RequestParam 校验失败：name 为空
GET {{baseUrl}}/param?name=

### 7. @RequestParam 校验失败：name 长度只有 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/param?name=a

### 8. 访问不存在的静态资源，触发 NoResourceFoundException
GET {{host}}/not-exist.html